Package: statsnzreleases
Title: Import Stats NZ Economic Releases and Histories
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R:
    person("Data Viewer", "Maintainers", email = "maintainers@example.invalid",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discovers, downloads, caches, and standardises data files attached
    to major Stats NZ economic information releases. The package uses the
    official Stats NZ release calendar and information-release pages rather
    than assuming that each release has migrated to Aotearoa Data Explorer.
    It preserves attachment-level provenance and supports reproducible reads
    from explicit historical release URLs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
